<title>SINGAPORE: Pertama posts loss for first half 1996.</title>
<headline>Pertama posts loss for first half 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 30 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    (loss) 1.47  vs (gain) 0.13</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	   (loss) 1.6   vs (gain) 0.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				94.12  vs 109.23</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.22  vs   0.33</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.82  vs   0.97</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     0.93  vs   0.81</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 (loss) 1.08  vs   (gain) 0.69</p>
<p>    Tax					0.43  vs   0.57</p>
<p>Note - Consumer electronics and communications equipment distributor Pertama Holdings Ltd said performance was hit by the closure of three retail stores and a slowdown in the retail sector. The company expects performance to improve in the second half.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
</text>
